                            	  6206: Wizzrobe_DrawAndCheckCollisionsIntermittently:
                            	  6207:     ; If the teleporting distance remaining is even, then draw
                            	  6208:     ; and check collisions, else return.
                            	  6209:     ;
                            	  6210:     ; This means that when 0, the monster is walking.
                            	  6211:     ; So, draw and check collisions every frame.
                            	  6212:     ;
                            	  6213:     ; When not 0, the monster is teleporting, and must be drawn
                            	  6214:     ; translucently -- every other frame.
                            	  6215:     ;
