                            	  8034: __far_z_04_0085:
                            	  8035:     ; The animation timer has expired. There are two choices for arming it.
                            	  8036:     ;
                            	  8037:     ; When writhing after a hit, Gleeok animates faster.
                            	  8038:     ; So, when the writhing counter <> 0, set a shorter time (6).
