                            	  1689:     ; We'll get a 0 or 1 depending on the direction of the door.
                            	  1690:     ;
                            	  1691:     ; If the attribute of the door is "open", "key", or "key 2";
                            	  1692:     ; then you have shorter distance to cover. So use the
                            	  1693:     ; previous value as is to use indexes 0 and 1.
                            	  1694:     ;
