02:00048B32 00048B46        	  4421:     dc.l    ReverseObjDir   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00048B36 00048B4C        	  4422:     dc.l    Walker_AltDir_EndLoop   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
                            	  4423: 
